and income statement.\n  - Freelancers who leave their tax returns to tax accountants\n  - System engineers\n  - Students\n\nLearning objectives:\n  - Acquire important and basic journal entries.\n  - Students will be able to understand the structure of balance sheets and income statements and their basic meanings.\n\nWhat you will learn in Accounting Quest: 1.\n1. understand the structure of the balance sheet\n2. understand the structure of the income statement\n3. understand the relationship between the balance sheet and the income statement\n4. to understand how to write journal entries, which are accounting records of transactions\n5. to understand how to make journal entries\n6. compile records (journal entries) and prepare financial statements", "short_description": "Go on an adventure, and learn basic accounting!\nYou are transported back in time to the Age of Discovery. You will experience a simulated series of business activities such as fundraising, purchasing, and sales, and learn accounting while having an adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.accounting-adventure.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Forevertail Co Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.accounting-adventure.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1207823920110008"}, "review_messag